{"h":2857,"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.06330342058488625,"t":"Test 2","c":1,"h":0.015835019239101245,"x":0.08106685507226985,"w":0.052399161656697585},{"y":0.11046511634418021,"h":0.015988371937820545,"w":0.11591695149739584,"t":"READING","x":0.38408304665749804,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.081314879127060688,"h":0.016159251155012377,"y":0.17424772550532686,"t":"READING PASSAGE 1","w":0.25778546651204426},{"x":0.081314872953877473,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 1-13, which are based on Reading","y":0.21063680890445347,"w":0.70588236490885414,"h":0.019014353848905152,"c":1},{"y":0.23093072109627388,"c":1,"x":0.081314876061000796,"t":"Passage 1 below.","w":0.14532872517903647,"h":0.017615790797581243},{"y":0.27034883717530556,"t":"Do animals dream?","c":1,"w":0.26989618937174475,"h":0.021813514100829545,"x":0.30968858356760243},{"y":0.3126434263747313,"x":0.081249883697874267,"w":0.70428543090820317,"t":"Studies using electrodes attached to the heads of sleepers have shown that when we","h":0.020635177740439992,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.022708839432520889,"w":0.70608927408854172,"x":0.081208571700812235,"y":0.33060193159010598,"t":"sleep, we do so in two ways that alternate throughout the night. The first is rapid eye"},{"w":0.69561375935872394,"x":0.081261719682002631,"t":"movement (REM) or active sleep. During this stage our eyes move, even though our","y":0.35003156585657269,"h":0.020775607451431588,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"eyelids are closed. Our muscles also twitch slightly, though they are largely paralysed","x":0.081314867207484265,"w":0.70415227254231771,"h":0.018942136877979521,"y":0.36913925843465445},{"w":0.67148976643880209,"h":0.021998271982180961,"y":0.38603887992433505,"c":1,"t":"so we don' t hurt ourselves. In contrast, we also engage in non-REM sleep, during","x":0.08121205689388318},{"c":1,"x":0.081254113031155276,"y":0.40471643304421356,"w":0.72332097371419268,"t":"which we barely move at all. Most dream states, and certainly those with the most vivid","h":0.021023956523065102},{"c":1,"x":0.083044988583767271,"w":0.29411763509114586,"t":"dreams, happen during REM sleep.","h":0.01894518876926643,"y":0.42582225305364241},{"x":0.082965081915839206,"c":1,"h":0.021697708407509619,"w":0.7129689025878907,"t":"There's some evidence that other mammals may also dream. For example, researchers","y":0.45914591450023945},{"y":0.47598196608776577,"x":0.082897766995239125,"c":1,"t":"compared the brain patterns of rats running through a maze when awake with their","w":0.68888488769531253,"h":0.02410380001081458},{"x":0.082955212210601564,"t":"brain patterns during REM sleep. They found the patterns were very similar and","w":0.65763844807942717,"h":0.022072436344047985,"y":0.49546217861438946,"c":1},{"t":"concluded that the sleeping rats were dreaming about going through the maze.","h":0.022190019915869663,"c":1,"x":0.08295828584676343,"y":0.51370566872026679,"w":0.66277715047200514},{"w":0.68178614298502604,"c":1,"h":0.021171639898258765,"x":0.084711864161830158,"y":0.55032175711178533,"t":"But finding evidence of dreaming in non-mammals has proved more difficult. Their"},{"c":1,"y":0.56892195666929268,"h":0.021305990519433604,"w":0.69739654541015628,"t":"brains are very different from those of humans, and it can often be difficult to record","x":0.082972987039659926},{"x":0.082958693074824952,"t":"their activity while they are sleeping. Recently, however, researchers succeeded in","h":0.02265458744334703,"y":0.58707140132887692,"w":0.67492655436197924,"c":1},{"w":0.69739349365234371,"y":0.6050415797472275,"t":"recording brain activity in sleeping pigeons. As in mammals, the recordings revealed","h":0.021682105921964845,"x":0.08297292572344285,"c":1},{"w":0.65937271118164054,"t":"both REM and non-REM sleep. Intriguingly, REM sleep activity was high in brain","h":0.022770760858534356,"c":1,"x":0.084673059734343928,"y":0.62300415755229011},{"t":"regions involved in processing visual information, especially images related to physical","w":0.71636611938476558,"c":1,"y":0.64230163790141814,"x":0.081269872986742556,"h":0.021491992381838632},{"c":1,"y":0.6607275985447072,"h":0.02110002089247498,"t":"activities such as flying, which suggests that this may possibly be what the pigeons","x":0.082973453346155371,"w":0.6835243733723958},{"c":1,"x":0.083044984392543195,"y":0.68159552121932909,"t":"were dreaming about.","h":0.017532386005633893,"w":0.18512110392252606},{"x":0.082998816068448875,"y":0.71602721851979834,"h":0.019898097610206666,"t":"That said, dreaming and REM sleep are unlikely to be universal in the animal kingdom.","w":0.7163491821289063,"c":1},{"w":0.68009618123372395,"c":1,"y":0.73341453233471698,"h":0.022354618496958301,"t":"For example, sponges don't have brains, so they lack the machinery for dreaming.","x":0.084679428624229544},{"t":"There are also some animals with unusual sleep patterns. These include whales and","x":0.084699469715093484,"h":0.020112696354667836,"w":0.68701146443684902,"y":0.75229828258113085,"c":1},{"t":"dolphins, which do not shut down their entire brain when they sleep, but only half of","c":1,"w":0.70087137858072923,"y":0.77030505045108888,"h":0.021334700187325417,"x":0.084696775761649967},{"h":0.020715957091687165,"t":"it, keeping the rest awake. They also show no sign of REM sleep, suggesting that they","x":0.084715892984140173,"y":0.78915115426984561,"w":0.7111856587727865,"c":1},{"w":0.70606277465820311,"x":0.084682484197167007,"h":0.022813024180514341,"y":0.80583524217543701,"t":"may only experience non-REM dreams, which are less vivid. This is surprising because","c":1},{"y":0.82558139514368578,"w":0.68339101155598958,"x":0.084775086198648736,"t":"we tend to think of whales and dolphins as having complex inner lives. It's thought","c":1,"h":0.019065210917681763},{"x":0.084696552255135671,"y":0.84366860759416773,"h":0.021442136370776965,"t":"that they don't experience REM sleep because during REM sleep animals are more","w":0.68527526855468746,"c":1},{"w":0.33237869262695313,"x":0.084690896656058737,"y":0.86357423930681543,"h":0.017724116587655603,"t":"vulnerable to extremes of temperature.","c":1},{"t":"38","y":0.96220930261480031,"c":1,"x":0.084775086970729274,"h":0.014534882851794828,"w":0.022491348584493004}]}